<title>JAPAN: ALPINE SKIING-WORLD CUP DOWNHILL TRAINING PLACINGS.</title>
<headline>ALPINE SKIING-WORLD CUP DOWNHILL TRAINING PLACINGS.</headline>
<dateline>HAKUBA, Japan 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of the first</p>
<p>official training run at a womens World Cup downhill on Tuesday:</p>
<p>  1. Stefanie Schuster (Austria)     1 minute 37.46 seconds</p>
<p>  2. Svetlana Gladishiva (Russia)    1:37.77</p>
<p>  3. Michaela Dorfmeister (Austria)  1:38.35</p>
<p>  4. Hilde Gerg (Germany)		1:38.65</p>
<p>  5. Brigitte Obermoser (Austria)    1:38.82</p>
<p>  6. Bibiana Perez (Italy)	     1:39.03</p>
<p>  7. Florence Masnada (France)	 1:39.35</p>
<p>  8. Regine Cavagnoud (France)	 1:39.60</p>
<p>  9. Alexandra Meissnitzer (Austria) 1:39.72</p>
<p> 10. Marie Joelle Clement (Canada)   1:39.79</p>
